Summary::md.summary
  On touch screen uis, when you do a two-finger zoom in or out, the pan position starts jumping around like crazy. This is only reproducible on real touch screen device (ipad, phone, etc.)
Resolved Mar 19, 2022, 04:22PM::md.update
  It seems this was solved by disabling panning during gestures and checking the pointerid while panning
